Title: Multistate hazard models for interval censored data, including hidden Markov models
Package: mshmm
Version: 1.0-3
Date: 2026-04-03
Depends: survival, Matrix, R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:  parallel, mvtnorm, quadprog
Suggests: msm, knitr
Lazyload: Yes
LazyData: Yes
Description: Fit multi-state hazard (MSH) for data that is interval censored.
 This includes both simple interval censoring as well as multi-state hidden 
 Markov models (HMM). These methods are complimentary to the parallel methods 
 for MSH found in the survival package, e.g., non-parametric Aalen-Johansen
 curves and MSH models fit with coxph.  The user interface in particular has 
 been made similar.
VignetteBuilder: knitr
